<http://data.silknow.org/object/755e2d70-6f07-3663-81d4-518abad30847/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of woven silk and metal threads.\n\nWarp: pink silk and grey silk, both Z twist\nWeft: silk: pink, grey and yellow, all indeterminable twist.\nMetal thread: silver strip S-wound on a cream silk core, indeterminable twist. \nGrey ground with an incomplete pattern of right-facing botehs in one row, infilled with a flowering stem, terminating in a small drop boteh pendant. In between large botehs, at their bases, a small vase form from which a symmetrical flowering stem emerges.  In the remaining spaces are fish (or more probably a leaf form).  The motifs are all in metal thread with yellow details."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/755e2d70-6f07-3663-81d4-518abad30847> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/755e2d70-6f07-3663-81d4-518abad30847/category/1>
